GrooveGen v1.0
Snapshot date: 2026-06-03
Owner: Daniel Llamas (PhD, CU Boulder — Brain Music Lab / ATLAS)

v1.0 scope
==========
Parametric, literature-grounded groove-stimulus generator (Python; pretty_midi + FluidSynth).
- Five knobs LOCKED to literature target bands and verified by manipulation checks:
    syncopation (Witek index)  0 / 16 / 32 / 49
    event density (onsets/bar) 5 / 9 / 15 / 25
    swing (swing fraction)     50% / 56% / 62% / 67%
    tempo (BPM, if swept)      70 / 95 / 115 / 150
    microtiming (ms RMS, ctrl) 0 / 5.9 / 12.6 / 29.5
- Frozen, time-invariant study bed (hero_study): isolates each knob as the sole variable.
- 5 bed profiles: hero (demo song), hero_study (study bed), dorian_vamp, pop_loop, anthemic_lift.
- 20-stimulus manifest (5 knobs x 4 levels) logging achieved manipulation-check values.
- Sophia secondary analysis (n=122 / 643 unique tracks) grounding the bed feature profile.

